<title>TURKEY: Key Turk rightists say won't join caretaker govt.</title>
<headline>Key Turk rightists say won't join caretaker govt.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A right-wing Turkish party key to the balance of power in parliament said on Friday it would not join a planned caretaker government to take the country to early polls.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not want to enter a government which is going to an election,&quot; Muhsin Yazicioglu, leader of the Grand Unity Party, said.</p>
</text>
